{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近今まで以上に身体を考えた食事をしてる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分に外食禁止と野菜主食令を出してるの(^O^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanami.hashimoto/img/0000-71.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も、晩ご飯きっちり１膳食べきりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり自分の家のテーブルに暖かい食事が並ぶのいいねー(*^◯^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家にいるときはいつも前髪ぜんぶ留めてるよーおでこ全開 笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は朝早い！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"起きれるかな、、；＿；"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がんばって寝るぞーー！起きるぞー！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"４時に起こしてー！おやすみ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑これよくお母さんにメールする文章笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"携帯が 起こしてー！って打つと、勝手に\nおやすみ！って出してくれるようになった笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、ガキ使にサンシャイン池崎さんでてる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日自己紹介長い！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ（･ε･)"}],"source":"archive"}